@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "System / Customer" as User
participant "BookingPage" as UI
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "BookingController" as Controller
participant "BookingWorkflowService" as Service
participant "ExtraServiceRepository / BookingServiceItemRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-19: Check Extra Service Availability ==

User -> UI : 1. Change selected service quantities
activate User
activate UI

UI -> App : 2. checkout preview effect
activate App

App -> App : 3. Validate UI state and build request
activate App
deactivate App

App -> Controller : 4. POST /api/bookings/checkout-preview
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. previewCheckout(request)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. calculateServiceTotal(); validateServiceQuantity()
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
Service -> Repo : 7. findById; sumReservedForOverlappingSlots
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT service; SUM reserved quantity
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Service and reserved quantity
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Return service total and revised checkout
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Inactive/out-of-stock/over max -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> App : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

App -> App : 15. setCheckout or setCheckoutError
activate App
deactivate App

App --> UI : 16. Show availability/pricing feedback
deactivate App

UI --> User : 17. Updated screen or error feedback

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
